              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 34:18",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 34,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "The princes of Judah, and the princes of Jerusalem, the eunuchs, and the priests, and all the people of the land, which passed between the parts of the calf;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 34:19",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 34,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "I will even give them into the hand of their enemies, and into the hand of them that seek their life: and their dead bodies shall be for meat unto the fowls of the heaven, and to the beasts of the earth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "Jer. 22:25."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Jer. 22:25.",
            "prettyString": "Jeremiah 22:25",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "jeremiah",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 22,
                    "end": 22,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 25,
                        "end": 25
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 34:20",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 34,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "And Zedekiah king of Judah and his princes will I give into the hand of their enemies, and into the hand of them that seek their life, and into the hand of the king of Babylon’s army, which are gone up from you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jeremiah 34:21",
        "book": "Jeremiah",
        "chapter": 34,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, I will command, saith the Lord, and cause them to return to this city; and they shall fight against it, and take it, and burn it with fire: and I will make the cities of Judah a desolation without an inhabitant.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
